    skos:scopeNote "Real-world (limited). The DfE Online Education Accreditation Scheme is a non-statutory, voluntary scheme; online provider as a type has no primary legislation. Distinct Details tab presentation: open date becomes accreditation date, close date becomes accreditation date ended, and an accreditation and quality assurance section replaces several standard school fields."@en ;
    skos:broader est:EstablishmentTypeGroupOnlineProviders ;
    dcterms:source "Type code 49"@en ;
    est:status "Provisional"@en .

